Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 21:33:34 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 17/29] patch: swallow - terminal hides itself when it launches
 a GUI app

Conflicts: Client struct gained isterm/noswallow/pid/swallowing/swallowedby
alongside btrtile's was_tiled and cfact's cweight; closed with }; since btrtile
had already converted it to a named struct.
